      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "In 1899, Pawnee Rock was designated a state historic site, and it earned a National Register nomination in 1970.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        4
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.kansashistory.gov/p/pawnee-rock-plan-your-visit/11906",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Pawnee Rock State Historic Site offers a pavilion where visitors can enjoy a 360‑degree view of the Arkansas River Valley.",
